OL,3,GNEWSAMore buses to hospitals part of
OL,4,A'People's Network'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew bus services connecting suburbs to
OL,7,Fmajor hospitals are part of plans for
OL,8,Fthe publicly-run South Yorkshire
OL,9,FPeople's Network.
OL,11,FThe bus network begins operating in
OL,12,FSeptember 2027, with Sheffield and
OL,13,FDoncaster part of the first phase and
OL,14,FBarnsley and Rotherham in the second.
OL,16,FThe region's mayor, Oliver Coppard,
OL,17,Ftold a briefing that the service would
OL,18,Fbe more reliable and punctual.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
